  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irradiation Presentation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Presented a lecture/presentation regarding commodity approval (market access) and the use of irradiation as a Phytosanitary treatment. The Korean Society of Plant Pathology invited APHIS to provide a keynote lecture at the 50th Anniversary of the KSPP to be held a Seoul National University in Seoul, Korea on October 24-27, 2012. A USDA/APHIS Senior Risk Manager with APHIS/PPQ represented APHIS at this event. .The main theme of the conference is &quot;Globalization, Climate Change, and Technological Convergence: Challenge and Opportunity of Plant Pathology. Additional information regarding the conference is found at www.kspp.org</narrative>
  </description>
